     The REAL main.js booted through the REAL run path (stubbed query.php +
     manage_journal.php) on the jrowfeat suite's 36-row fixture: key "PROTOCOL NO." +
     "PROTOCOL TYPE", one toggle "Reviewed" (key toggle1), row notes on, rows 3 and
     23 marked. ?scn=<name> picks the stored report state; driver.js runs it.
